{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss","id":111165,"title":"So What did I miss?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-11T19:09:09-07:00","id":111165,"title":"So What did I miss?","content":"Wow. Long time since I've been on a World of Darkness site really. I got interested in after a thread post on the Escapist got me angry as they bitched about the NWOD and how it made Vampires &quot;Twilight-Sparkle-Bullshit&quot;<br /> <br /> Made me jump over to the White Wolf forums and... no forums. That was weird. <br /> <br /> Happen to recognize Onyx Path and clicked it and saw that there was a forum here. <br /> <br /> Okay so I've been out of White-Wolf WOD/Other news for about three years. What did I miss?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:28:52-07:00","id":111167,"title":"","content":"Hamburgers eat People now!<br /> <br /> Oh and essentially we are getting NWOD 2nd ed one gameline at a time with Chronicle Books. So far we got a core redux with the Godmachine Chronicle, each chronicle also fills in the void absent from the complete removal of Metaplot between NWOD and CWOD. So for instance Vampire got Blood and Smoke: The Strix Chronicle with the Strix providing some foe besides vampires to really model a game around. Next up is Werewolf the Idigam Chronicles and Fallen World Chronicles for Mage.<br /> <br /> The New rules are snazzy though, an actual interactive exp system and some nice basic tightening of the rules.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also we've been getting new CWOD books, particularly the 20th anniversary books, so far Mage just finished its kickstarter with over half a million Dollars.<br /> <br /> Yeah The White Wolf Be alive like never before yo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:29:43-07:00","id":111169,"title":"","content":"Oh and Welcome home Deimos! Long time no see!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:31:28-07:00","id":111171,"title":"","content":"Interesting. I had head of Godmachine Chronicle through other means but though it was just a source book. Interesting to know its basically 2nd Ed. I was really worried with the Vamp 20th and the Mage 20th Kickstarter that White Wolf had just sort of given up on the NWOD.<br /> <br /> Glad to hear they haven't","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:37:26-07:00","id":111177,"title":"","content":"hey welcome back man! its been a long time. Glad to see you made the transition as well and I'm guessing things are going better for you now as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:40:13-07:00","id":111180,"title":"","content":"Deimos! God damn, now there's an avi I've missed!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:54:14-07:00","id":111188,"title":"","content":"Truth be told the reason I've been gone for so long was a nasty eviction that ended up with all my WOD books in a storage locker for some time. I'm still roleplaying but on a super-hero themed MUX.<br /> <br /> If it weren't for some people talking bad about VtR I probably wouldn't have even thought to check for the forums. But hey here I am, seems like I have a lot to catch up on as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:58:28-07:00","id":111195,"title":"","content":"It's a whole new world, almost literally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T19:59:30-07:00","id":111196,"title":"","content":"Damn that means I've got some buying to do and probably 400+ NPCs that need updating. Damn &quot;Updates&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T20:28:02-07:00","id":111205,"title":"","content":"Okay I know it's sort of lame to respond to post right after you posted but I do have to ask. Why are we on Onyx Path instead of White Wolf's own site? It seems weird for an entertainment product company to not have a forum on its own site.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T20:36:26-07:00","id":111208,"title":"","content":"I am posting this from the F.A.Q. as it best answers your question.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Q: <i>What is the Onyx Path?</i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A. Onyx Path Publishing is a company founded in January 2012 by White Wolf Creative Director Rich Thomas. Following October 2011\u2032s layoffs at CCP, CCP/White Wolf was no longer in a good position to do publishing in addition to the main business of making computer games. As a result, Rich founded Onyx Path Publishing to handle this business.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Onyx Path Publishing (OPP) has three main focuses at the moment:</span></span></span><ul><li>We are the licensed publisher for White Wolf\u2019s tabletop RPG settings: the <b>World of Darkness</b>, the <b>Classic World of Darkness</b>, and <b>Exalted</b>.</li> <li>We publish our own tabletop RPG settings: <b>Scion</b> and the <b>Trinity Continuum</b>. Both were once White Wolf properties, but OPP now owns them outright.</li> <li>We publish creator-owned properties: Rose Bailey\u2019s <b>Cavaliers of Mars</b> is the first, with more to come.</li> </ul><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Q. <i>What about Mind\u2019s Eye Theatre, or Vampire: The Eternal Struggle?</i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A. Our license allows us to publish White Wolf tabletop RPGs and novels only. This does not include the live-action MET rules. At the time of this writing, MET has been licensed to By Night Studios.</span></span></span><br /> </div> </div> </div>The heart and soul of the table top side of the house resides here now. Shane DeFreest and the By Night Studios team is handling the LARP side.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T20:48:46-07:00","id":111217,"title":"","content":"Wow... I did miss a lot. Thanks for the information.<br /> <br /> I... don't know how I feel about all that. But I understand how it goes. Still. Wow what a crazy road White Wolf has taken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T21:25:05-07:00","id":111238,"title":"","content":"I just realized that all my NWOD knowledge is outdated. That makes me feel weird since I used to argue rules all the time. I'm outdated. I'm starting to feel like I did before I got the NWOD books and was still just a CWOD guy.<br /> <br /> I'll get caught up pretty fast, but even a glance at the NWOD forum... I have no idea what Beats are. I hear Virtue and Vice are no longer the seven deadlies and holies. Vampires don't even use them?<br /> <br /> *brain explodes*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T21:32:32-07:00","id":111244,"title":"","content":"*sings* A Whole New Wooooorld! A darkening place you never knew! And now that you're ba-ack here, it's crystal clear, that you've got some catching up to do!<br /> <br /> *coughs*<br /> <br /> Yeah, even if we disregard the company change and the new modus operandi for a lot of things, and even if we keep it just to the new World of Darkness, the entire metaverse has still gotten some serious updates and revisions. Vampires are cool again, Demons are in your wi-fi, Mummies will blow you up for your socks, Experience is now an actual experience, and a thousand and one other things.<br /> <br /> Start with the God Machine Chronicle Rules Update(available <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/114078/World-of-Darkness-The-God-Machine-Rules-Update\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> for free) and pick your way from there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T21:39:50-07:00","id":111253,"title":"","content":"Thanks for that ArcaneArts. That'll help a lot!<br /> <br /> Damn, I've been gone so long... Mummy was still being revealed last time I was around. Except for random posts in the old BABES! forum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T21:43:04-07:00","id":111260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeimosMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss?p=111238#post111238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just realized that all my NWOD knowledge is outdated. That makes me feel weird since I used to argue rules all the time. I'm outdated. I'm starting to feel like I did before I got the NWOD books and was still just a CWOD guy.<br /> <br /> I'll get caught up pretty fast, but even a glance at the NWOD forum... I have no idea what Beats are. I hear Virtue and Vice are no longer the seven deadlies and holies. Vampires don't even use them?<br /> <br /> *brain explodes*</div> </div> </div> </div>Short short version, beats are an award for doing something cool, challenging or otherwise dealing with difficulty or generally being awesome in a scene. 5(iirc) beats get converted to 1xp. <br /> <br /> If you've been out of the picture that long, There was also Mummy that came out, Demon the Decent (nwod) which seems kinda cool.<br /> The old Aeon superhero thingie white wolf owned (now owned by OPP) is getting a new version<br /> Scion is getting a new version (scion is also now owned by OPP)<br /> Exalted is getting a new version, and from what I can say is actually not only playable (unlike 2e) it's not a mechanical nightmare and is fun. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T21:44:30-07:00","id":111262,"title":"","content":"We're in the process of getting updates to the main game lines, and most likely the limited run lines as well, using the God Machine Chronicle rules changes. I'll be picking up Blood and Smoke and Demon the Descent relatively soon, I was waiting for them to made available PoD. The hard copies for me and the pdfs will be a gift to my brother for our birthdays next month, the b-days are a day apart and I'm going to London to visit him next month. I'll also be seeing Lunatyk and Mithras while I'm there, Mithras stopped posting on the old forums a while ago but we still chat from time to time. I'm thinking a World's End style pub crawl, minus the blue goo robots. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T22:01:00-07:00","id":111265,"title":"","content":"Wait! What! Morality is replaced with Integrity! <br /> <br /> Where is Mr. Gone's character sheets? Why do none have Integrity. I'm so confused! Save me!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T22:04:18-07:00","id":111270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss?p=111262#post111262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're in the process of getting updates to the main game lines, and most likely the limited run lines as well, using the God Machine Chronicle rules changes. I'll be picking up Blood and Smoke and Demon the Descent relatively soon, I was waiting for them to made available PoD. The hard copies for me and the pdfs will be a gift to my brother for our birthdays next month, the b-days are a day apart and I'm going to London to visit him next month. I'll also be seeing Lunatyk and Mithras while I'm there, Mithras stopped posting on the old forums a while ago but we still chat from time to time. I'm thinking a World's End style pub crawl, minus the blue goo robots. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Wait...You're still in contact with Lunatyk and Mithras! Tell them I say &quot;Hello!&quot; even though they may not remember me. Hell if ChristianA and JimB and Mr. Gone show up, it'll be an old school party reunion.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T22:13:22-07:00","id":111274,"title":"","content":"Onyx Path is pretty big on Kickstarters these days.<br /> So far the most profitable of them has been the one for Exalted 3rd Edition Core. With WoD's new Mage Core coming in a close second.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T23:25:15-07:00","id":111301,"title":"","content":"Just a heads up in case you were thinking of making one, Babes-style threads are no longer permissible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T23:39:00-07:00","id":111306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss?p=111301#post111301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just a heads up in case you were thinking of making one, Babes-style threads are no longer permissible.</div> </div> </div> </div>JimB! Okay this is starting to feel like the ending of Buffy. <br /> <br /> Yeah I was only promoting my lady in those posts. I have no interest in continuing those threads.<br /> <br /> I also want make sure I know this... JimB.... you've been on the Escapist right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T09:14:10-07:00","id":111530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeimosMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss?p=111306#post111306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">JimB....you've been on <b>the Escapist</b>, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been on their forums (I doubt if you were asking if I'm a content producer, but just in case you were, I'm not), though only rarely. I do not care for the community there, and have to be pretty powerfully riled up to overcome my dislike of the people who are most likely to speak to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-13T02:15:43-07:00","id":111961,"title":"","content":"Hi <b>Deimos</b>, long time no see! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeimosMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss?p=111270#post111270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait...You're still in contact with Lunatyk and Mithras! Tell them I say &quot;Hello!&quot; even though they may not remember me. Hell if ChristianA and JimB and Mr. Gone show up, it'll be an old school party reunion.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I may add some info - <b>Lunatyk</b> is part of our Polish MtAw fan group on Facebook - he say's that he maybe starting new chroncicle, somewhere, but has second thoughts because of his histroy with players. I try too persuade him to play, especially after <b>God Machine Chronicle</b> Rules. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Mr. Gone</b> has personal stuff on his head, but he makes in spare time general sheets for settings postGMC. We play now foruth month on his post<b>GMC</b> Mage Sheets.<br /> <br /> And I'm running London game about ancient Atlanetean Temples, first Hindu gods in Earth's Chakras and coming of new Hieromagus from our little apartment in Lublin, Poland. Did I said I ordered <a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/theonyxpath/works/11800061-skull-mage-the-awakening?body_color=black&amp;c=281138-mage-the-awakening&amp;p=t-shirt&amp;print_location=front&amp;ref=work_collections_grid&amp;style=mens\" target=\"_blank\">Mage Skull T-Shirt</a>? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://ih2.redbubble.net/image.16436315.0061/fig,black,mens,ffffff.u1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-13-2014, 05:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-13T12:10:46-07:00","id":112162,"title":"","content":"Its been so long, what was Lunatyk's Avatar again? I remember Mithras when he left ages ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T19:43:11-07:00","id":114498,"title":"","content":"Lunatyk's avatar is a picture of him with a black hole in his forehead. When I see him and John I'll make sure to pass along the greeting. Jim, MrGone and Christian are all still around, Christian pops up a lot in the Forsaken forums, Jim's all over the place and hard to miss. Sorry it took so long to reply, I've only been checking in to see if any reports needed addressing and haven't followed up on threads I posted in over the weekend. Are you still near Tampa? I travel down there a few times a year because my mom and youngest brother still live in Palm Harbor.<br /> <br /> edit, replied before seeing Jim had responded.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":11,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","user":"Darksider","date":". 04-16-2014, 10:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T21:43:52-07:00","id":114536,"title":"","content":"Yeah Darksider, we are in Tarpon now. Next time you are in town, at the very least we need to hang out for Starbucks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T21:45:46-07:00","id":114538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss?p=111530#post111530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been on their forums (I doubt if you were asking if I'm a content producer, but just in case you were, I'm not), though only rarely. I do not care for the community there, and have to be pretty powerfully riled up to overcome my dislike of the people who are most likely to speak to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, they've got their share of dumb-dumb heads over there. There's some cool people, of course, but a lot of pretentious twits and people who just complain or attack others who make up a lot of posts (if not members, vocal minority and all that).<br /> <br /> But yeah, some very exciting stuff going on these days with OPP/WW. Personally, I'm eagerly awaiting the new Werewolf: W:tF didn't really work for me, but the new one is sounding pretty cool from what's been put out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T04:17:08-07:00","id":114650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeimosMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss?p=111265#post111265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait! What! Morality is replaced with Integrity!<br /> <br /> Where is Mr. Gone's character sheets? Why do none have Integrity. I'm so confused! Save me!</div> </div> </div> </div>Welcome back man! Long time no see.<br /> <br /> Yea, I'm still around. Not as much as I used to be, but I'm still here.<br /> <br /> While I do have some God-Machince sheets(listed in the NWoD/NWoD section, just scroll down a bit), I'm behind on converting some of the games over to the new rules. I keep hoping OP will get around to converting them, then I'll have more to go on for each of the game lines, but they're working on so much who knows when that will happen.<br /> <br /> But anyway, I've been keeping busy. I've done some official sheets for Onyx Path and had several published. Hoping to do more. I also done some sheets for a few other companies, most recently Margaret Weis and the new Firefly RPG. So that was really cool.<br /> <br /> But anyway, I'm still working. Alittle slower than I used to, but I'll eventually get around to stuff. You can always send me an email with a request. :P<br /> <br /> Welcome back!<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeimosMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/111165-so-what-did-i-miss?p=111270#post111270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait...You're still in contact with Lunatyk and Mithras! Tell them I say &quot;Hello!&quot; even though they may not remember me. Hell if ChristianA and JimB and Mr. Gone show up, it'll be an old school party reunion.</div> </div> </div> </div>I still talk with Lunatyk from time to time as well. I see him on Facebook. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" targe